# deadlock_cycle_detection — deadlock cycle detection
# (README §16). Tests detecting deadlock potential.

DeadlockCycleDetection is project
DeadlockCycleDetection module examplesDeadlockCycleDetection
DeadlockCycleDetection target console
DeadlockCycleDetection entry main

examplesDeadlockCycleDetection is module
examplesDeadlockCycleDetection path examples.deadlockCycleDetection
examplesDeadlockCycleDetection exports main
examplesDeadlockCycleDetection purpose "Demonstrate deadlock cycle detection"
examplesDeadlockCycleDetection invariant "Deadlocks are prevented"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main async yes
main memory heap no
main purpose "Detect deadlock cycles"
main invariant "Deadlock detection works"

main let code immutable ExitCode 0
main return code
